# PX4 Gazebo Classic X500 HITL interface and Quad-X HIL mapping overlay.
# Simulation only, props removed. Back up real-aircraft parameters first.
# Assumes MAVLink instance 1 on TELEM2, TX/RX/GND, 921600 baud.
# FLOW_CTRL=0 forces RTS/CTS off. No motion tuning or failsafe overrides.
# Verify firmware support, airframe, HIL motor channels and failsafes in QGC.
# Reboot after import. This file has not been validated in a new HITL flight.
